<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Constraint Origin Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che distingue le costrizioni riprese dalla tradizione da quelle introdotte ex novo in uno specifico contesto compositivo. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constraintOrigin."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concept scheme distinguishing between traditional constraints and newly introduced constraints in a specific compositional context. Expected as the range value of desmos:constraintOrigin."@en .
